<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Aug trade surplus 9.5 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Swedish Aug trade surplus 9.5 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's August trade surplus was 9.5 billion crowns, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     Aug 96     July 96    Aug 95</p>
<p> Exports			 43.6	 38.7	 43.4</p>
<p> Imports			 34.1	 29.2	 39.5</p>
<p> Trade balance		 +9.5	 +9.5	 +3.9</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a 5.0 billion crown surplus.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
